    <string name="sound_source_custom">my own sounds</string>
    <string name="sound_intro">MetroKeys uses Android’s click sounds. If you have your own sound files (WAV), you can use them here: one each for letter keys, the space bar, function keys, the alternates picker, choosing a suggestion and adding to the dictionary. The files stay on this device only and aren’t backed up. Only import files you’re allowed to use.</string>
